    "summary": "Wargear, 1 CP. Use it in your Shooting phase, right after one of your IRONKIN STEELJACKS, ARKANYST EVALUATOR or BRÔKHYR units has shot; that unit is the target. Pick one enemy unit that is neither a MONSTER nor a VEHICLE and that at least one of those attacks hit. Until your next Shooting phase begins, whenever it makes a Normal move, an Advance move or a Fall Back move, roll a D6 for every model in it; each roll of 1 inflicts 1 mortal wound on it, with at most 6 mortal wounds each time.",
